### 인기 콘텐츠 추천 (기본)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tourism/contents

###

### 인기 콘텐츠 추천 - 명시적
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tourism/contents?type=POPULAR&numOfRows=5

###

### 시기별 추천
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tourism/contents?type=SEASONAL&numOfRows=5

###

### 시기별 추천 - 10개
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tourism/contents?type=SEASONAL&numOfRows=10

###

### 인기 콘텐츠 - 10개
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tourism/contents?type=POPULAR&numOfRows=10